   146	
   147	- **Scene counts.** Chapter 35 has six scenes (the stair is divided at the last flight); chapter 36 has six (the groove and Seln's finding are divided); chapter 37 has seven (the light is its own scene after the inventory's first three entries). Chapters 34, 38, 39 and 40 have five. Thirty-nine scenes in all.
