     5	The two hundred and ninety-third day. The chamber under the registry. The lamp that was always lit and the one he held, and the other three hands at the rock wall with the boxes, and Cleon in his chair with both hands flat on nothing, and Karis at the table with a thing in front of her that had not been on the table before.
