   186	
   187	They had got the old man off the wheels at the dock's corner, as they were bidden. He stood between Cael and the wall, on one leg, with his left arm across a pair of shoulders and the stick in his right hand; and so they came along the paving to the hatch, three boots abreast and a fourth that did not touch.
   188	
