121:11. **Tail route — KEEP.** The route is author-owned and learns only access/patience, not identity or base (`manuscript/chapter-36.md:95–367`; `packets/MOVEMENT-006.md:55,75`).
122:12. **Parcel — KEEP.** Role-addressed through an established carrier chain; no restricted name is written or read at a counter (`manuscript/chapter-37.md:73–99`).
