+| 9. Who heard the leaf (`AUTHOR-REPORT.md:181`) | **KEEP** | Karis, Cleon, Cael and Vastin hear it; Lira and Brom are restoring the tall books (`manuscript/chapter-38.md:3–29,251–269`). That makes the fire page Lira's first reading as required (`manuscript/chapter-40.md:3–37`; `packets/MOVEMENT-006.md:58`). Source staging differs, but unprotected staging is not binding. |
