+| 11. Light comparison (`AUTHOR-REPORT.md:183`) | **AMEND** | Fix 37 removes the plate/attention comparison at `manuscript/chapter-37.md:251`; the deniable alternatives at `manuscript/chapter-37.md:253–267` remain. |
